Origin
------
The map and charts are the owner's own project, https://github.com/qunabu/poland-october-2026 (no licence file
there), imported at commit 541fa94 ("Add economy-size slide; stop the map re-framing on mobile scroll") and
rebuilt for ulams (2026-10-09, issues #148 and #149, ADR 0088): the inline page was split into index.html, app.js and
data/*.json; the story was rewritten as neutral public statistics in English and Polish; the bridge and the
shared map engine were added.

Not used on purpose
-------------------
- The saved copy of the third-party article this page was once written in reply to, its _files folder, and every
  sentence, framing, chapter title and link that referred to it.
- src/world.topo.json from that repository: it was copied from the article page. The map is regenerated from
  Natural Earth (scripts/build-topo.mjs).
- The screen recording and the research dumps of the repository.
- Every source entry that came only from the article, from press or aggregator reports or from an encyclopedia.
  A figure stays only when the institution that published it is linked (checked by scripts/check.mjs).
  Where a number could not be confirmed at its publisher it was replaced by the number the publisher gives or
  removed; see README.md, "What changed in the figures".

